WEBVTT

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:12.790
<i>What they knew was that it was a weapon.</i>

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:17.910
<i>It is not clear exactly how 
intelligent the Terraformars are,</i>

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:21.330
<i>but they did not know 
everything about lightning.</i>

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:25.500
<i>There is a place you</i>

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.550
<i>should never stand on a day
 when there is lightning.</i>

00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:32.870
<i>Lightning strike:</i>

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:36.420
<i>its power is six hundred million volts.</i>

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:39.320
<i>Unless you are lucky enough 
to be hit in good place by</i>

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:41.220
<i>the grace of the gods... 
you will die instantly.</i>

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:07.790
Division Leader...

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:10.100
Division Leader!

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:11.290
Division Leader!

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:13.290
Division Leader!

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:14.810
Division Leader!

00:03:15.870 --> 00:03:17.740
Division Leader!

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:19.640
Division Leader!

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:21.410
Division Leader!

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:23.550
Division Leader!

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:25.260
Division...

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:34.890
Division Leader...

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:37.450
Division Leader...

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.550
I told you...

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:56.290
it was dangerous...

00:03:57.020 --> 00:03:58.850
if you got wet...

00:04:23.890 --> 00:04:24.690
Hey...

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:26.870
Are you all right?

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:30.780
<i>Calm down. Calm down.</i>

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:34.260
<i>For some reason, the roaches stopped moving.</i>

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:36.790
<i>We have to use this chance</i>

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:44.800
<b><i>Wish</i></b>

00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:41.530
<i>to run... </i>

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:12.620
<i>The first primary cause:</i>

00:05:15.700 --> 00:05:16.610
<i>luck.</i>

00:05:19.730 --> 00:05:22.340
<i>That the electricity did not damage</i>

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:24.340
<i>the brain or the central nervous system.</i>

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:28.290
<i>The second primary cause: 
appropriate treatment.</i>

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:37.440
<i>Those are the two ways to survive 
from a lightning strike.</i>

00:05:54.430 --> 00:05:57.430
<i>They didn't know much about lightning,</i>

00:05:57.430 --> 00:05:59.880
<i>but this was after they 
had gotten some insight.</i>

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:02.470
<i>If anything, 
they realized that if they did this,</i>

00:06:02.470 --> 00:06:05.110
<i>blood would start circulating again.</i>

00:06:40.220 --> 00:06:41.080
No!

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:47.800
Division Leader! Eva!

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:26.540
<i>Eva Frost, age eighteen.</i>

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:29.120
<i>She was the daughter of a millionaire,</i>

00:07:29.120 --> 00:07:31.400
<i>yet she grew up in confinement.</i>

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:35.670
<i>Due to a financial crisis,
 they forcefully sold her to U-NASA.</i>

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:39.190
No! Please, run!

00:07:39.610 --> 00:07:42.550
<i>Uaku Ericson, age twenty-one.</i>

00:07:42.550 --> 00:07:45.170
<i>He grew up in the mountains of Peru.</i>

00:07:45.170 --> 00:07:47.890
<i>He hasn't any family, 
but he flew to Mars in order</i>

00:07:47.890 --> 00:07:51.150
<i>to repay his village's debt that was
 incurred after a bout of inclement weather.</i>

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:54.980
No! No! Let me go!

00:07:54.980 --> 00:07:57.160
The vaccine... For my child...

00:07:57.780 --> 00:08:00.010
<i>Sandra Hoffmann, age twenty-eight.</i>

00:08:00.350 --> 00:08:01.970
<i>Her husband passed away,</i>

00:08:01.970 --> 00:08:04.380
<i>and her seven-year-old son 
was infected with the virus.</i>

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:06.050
<i>In order to pay his hospital bills and</i>

00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:08.510
<i>to make the vaccine, she went to Mars.</i>

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:17.670
<i>Move... Move...</i>

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:27.890
<i>Move... Move...</i>

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:32.250
<i>Move... my body!</i>

00:08:41.570 --> 00:08:44.120
<i>I... have to...</i>

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:47.460
<i>I... have to...</i>

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:53.470
<i>protect them!</i>

00:09:04.170 --> 00:09:06.900
<i>I'm going to save them, no matter what,</i>

00:09:07.530 --> 00:09:08.900
<i>make the vaccine,</i>

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:10.300
<i>and then...</i>

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:12.530
<i>head back to Earth!</i>

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:15.740
<i>And then...</i>

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:18.760
<i>For sure, then...</i>

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:25.120
<i>I won't live a lie anymore.</i>

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:25.810
<i>Damn it...</i>

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:32.230
I can't... Adolf-san...

00:12:36.950 --> 00:12:42.340
I-I... don't want to leave you.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:11.470
Eva...

00:13:11.960 --> 00:13:14.880
R-Run... I beg of you...

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:38.380
G-Get away from us... 
I won't let you take him!

00:13:39.550 --> 00:13:45.380
H-He protected me
 to the point of being torn to pieces...

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:50.170
Adolf-san fought to the 
point of exhaustion...

00:13:51.410 --> 00:13:56.870
There's no way I'll let you take
 the Adolf-san that I love

00:13:56.870 --> 00:13:59.150
away!

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:30.740
<i>It was something that Adolf 
was unaware of himself.</i>

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:06.620
<i>It was indeed selfish.</i>

00:15:07.280 --> 00:15:09.320
<i>A mechanism that existed simply</i>

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:12.110
<i>to thwart any other country 
from stealing the research.</i>

00:15:15.700 --> 00:15:16.990
Adolf...

00:15:17.690 --> 00:15:20.640
Even if your father and I don't return,

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:24.570
live strong, and find 
someone like me someday.

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:30.800
Just like you were born between 
me and the one I fell in love with...

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:36.570
You'll be happy like that one day, too.

00:15:37.150 --> 00:15:39.370
Okay, Mom.

00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:42.770
But... If you can, please come back.

00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:03.480
<i>We're together, Adolf-san.</i>

00:16:20.360 --> 00:16:21.810
We're...

00:16:23.780 --> 00:16:28.410
a family that's connected through 
a stronger bond than blood.

00:16:56.560 --> 00:16:59.500
Division Leader, something 
happened toward 3 o'clock.

00:16:59.890 --> 00:17:00.950
3 o'clock?

00:17:01.190 --> 00:17:03.360
But 3 o'clock is where the No. 5 Division...

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:05.830
Are you sure, Alex?

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:09.050
Yeah, there was some huge explosion, or...

00:17:09.050 --> 00:17:11.280
I couldn't see it very well, 
but it looked like

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:13.590
there was some kind of brief light.

00:17:17.130 --> 00:17:18.240
<i>Adolf...</i>

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:24.110
<i>Damn it... Every country 
does such selfish things.</i>

00:17:39.310 --> 00:17:43.820
Oh, hello. This is Adolf Reinhardt's wife.

00:17:49.230 --> 00:17:52.660
Yes, I wanted to confirm the transfers that 
were supposed to be made from his pay...

00:17:57.210 --> 00:17:58.420
I'm sorry?

00:17:58.420 --> 00:18:01.730
<i>There is no one by that name here.</i>

00:18:02.230 --> 00:18:03.460
<i>Have a good day.</i>

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:04.660
What?

00:18:05.540 --> 00:18:07.150
What? W-Wait...

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:13.900
To think it'd happen the first day...

00:18:14.830 --> 00:18:17.400
We really underestimated the cockroaches.

00:18:17.850 --> 00:18:19.680
What happened to him is truly unfortunate.

00:18:20.190 --> 00:18:24.010
But I must say that his wife 
was rather harshly cut off.

00:18:24.010 --> 00:18:26.020
That was her own doing.

00:18:26.390 --> 00:18:29.480
There is no one related 
to him left in his house.

00:18:29.830 --> 00:18:31.300
Well...

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:34.830
Are you a virgin, Rokka-kun?

00:18:34.830 --> 00:18:36.640
Of course not.

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:39.570
Then cherish that bond.

00:18:43.820 --> 00:18:45.170
A strong man is made

00:18:45.170 --> 00:18:49.310
once he is able to have a trusting 
relationship with a strong woman.

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:50.420
Right...

00:18:53.800 --> 00:18:56.320
I was hopeful of Adolf and the others...

00:18:57.310 --> 00:18:58.790
But it can't be helped.

00:18:58.790 --> 00:19:00.840
Let's count on our other research.

00:19:30.330 --> 00:19:34.770
<i>Damn it! Roaches with projectile 
weapons is bad enough!</i>

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:39.360
<i>To think they have enough intelligence 
to break down our forces...</i>

00:19:50.640 --> 00:19:53.250
Keiji, I'll leave them to you.

00:19:53.610 --> 00:19:55.920
I've got to settle things with this guy.

00:19:56.390 --> 00:19:57.890
Yes, sir.

00:20:00.830 --> 00:20:04.680
What were you called, again? 
A something weevil?

00:20:05.240 --> 00:20:08.610
I don't really know, 
but you look pretty hard.

00:20:36.980 --> 00:20:38.590
Marcos! Don't push yourself too much!

00:20:39.270 --> 00:20:41.590
If you're defeated, we're...

00:20:42.350 --> 00:20:43.160
finished...

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:51.730
Marcos!

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:53.190
Marcos...

00:20:55.170 --> 00:20:58.720
<i>There's no way I'd be taken 
out by a lame pitch like that.</i>

00:21:00.740 --> 00:21:02.040
<i>Not to mention</i>

00:21:03.090 --> 00:21:05.360
<i>the No. 1 Division still has...</i>

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:51.910
<i>...M.A.R.S Ranking 15th place, Sanjo Kanako</i>

00:21:54.470 --> 00:21:57.710
<i>and Onizuka Keiji!</i>
